+Every intake includes a stable `intake_correlation_id`. The intake script stores it with the request SHA-256; a repeated delivery reuses the existing task ID, while changed content under the same key is rejected. Manager then returns `BOUNDARY_REQUIRED <task-id>` to the invoking project controller. This is maintenance control, not a product transition. The controller may send `TASK_READY` only after `compaction.json` contains four Codex receipts, one Opus receipt, and a validated unpinned project snapshot for the registered `project_id`.
